        <mxCell id="c51" value="&lt;b&gt;Each pair agrees to the cent in every year.&lt;/b&gt; The model&#x27;s materials, read through the receipt and issue lines and their items, equal the postings to account 1045 from GoodsReceipt and MaterialIssue. The two cards that count exceptions read 0: every receipt line reaches a requisition and every issue line a work order." style="rounded=0;arcSize=6;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#E8F6F3;strokeColor=#E8F6F3;strokeWidth=1;fontColor=#2C3E50;fontSize=12;fontStyle=0;align=left;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=Helvetica;spacingLeft=6;spacingRight=6;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="16" y="272" width="828" height="59" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
